{"slug": "C_S02E08", "video_name": "Community - S02E08 - Cooperative Calligraphy Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E08 - Cooperative Calligraphy Bluray-1080p Proper.en.srt", "duration_seconds": 1272.985, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 603, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.78, "text": "- Does anyone know how long it takes paper machete to dry?"}, {"start": 6.78, "end": 9.34, "text": "- Three hours longer than I took Duncan to think of this assignment."}, {"start": 9.34, "end": 11.13720930232558, "text": "- I think he's really gonna appreciate the"}, {"start": 11.13720930232558, "end": 13.02, "text": "extra work we did expanding our evolutionary"}, {"start": 13.02, "end": 14.02, "text": "chart."}, {"start": 14.02, "end": 15.02, "text": "Oh, brilliant!"}, {"start": 15.02, "end": 16.3, "text": "Can you hold up the final stage of humanity?"}, {"start": 16.3, "end": 18.38904761904762, "text": "I still think that man is going to evolve"}, {"start": 18.38904761904762, "end": 20.58, "text": "into woman, not a dragon monster with three"}, {"start": 20.58, "end": 21.58, "text": "legs."}, {"start": 21.58, "end": 22.58, "text": "- Three legs?"}, {"start": 22.58, "end": 24.5, "text": "Well, it's been real."}, {"start": 24.5, "end": 26.74, "text": "At least the pace smell has."}, {"start": 26.74, "end": 30.28, "text": "But I have a date to catch, or should I say, a catch to date."}, {"start": 30.28, "end": 32.42, "text": "- Oof, I hope you just came up with that."}, {"start": 32.42, "end": 33.42, "text": "- Look out!"}, {"start": 33.42, "end": 34.42, "text": "Drive-by deening!"}, {"start": 34.42, "end": 35.98, "text": "I'm not kidding."}, {"start": 35.98, "end": 38.85225806451613, "text": "Just a non-violent verbal reminder, the local shelter"}, {"start": 38.85225806451613, "end": 41.02, "text": "is having a puppy parade this afternoon."}, {"start": 41.02, "end": 42.02, "text": "- Aww!"}, {"start": 42.02, "end": 43.66, "text": "- Aww, I wanna lick it."}, {"start": 43.66, "end": 47.3, "text": "- I expect all of you to lend a paw."}, {"start": 47.3, "end": 50.14, "text": "Except you, Jeffrey, I know you've got a catch today."}, {"start": 50.14, "end": 52.86, "text": "- Oh, like you're famous for your wit."}, {"start": 52.86, "end": 53.86, "text": "- Puppy parade?"}, {"start": 53.86, "end": 54.86, "text": "- I am in."}, {"start": 54.86, "end": 57.98, "text": "I wanna see if those weena dogs are born that way, or if they start off normal and"}, {"start": 57.98, "end": 58.98, "text": "then get weena."}, {"start": 58.98, "end": 61.26, "text": "- Abed, did you pick up my pen?"}, {"start": 61.26, "end": 62.98, "text": "It's a purple pen with a gel grip?"}, {"start": 62.98, "end": 63.98, "text": "- Nope."}, {"start": 63.98, "end": 65.3, "text": "I'm strictly mechanical pencils these days."}, {"start": 65.3, "end": 66.3, "text": "- More relatable?"}, {"start": 66.3, "end": 68.06, "text": "- It was just here."}, {"start": 68.06, "end": 69.06, "text": "- You okay, Annie?"}, {"start": 69.06, "end": 70.06, "text": "Chocolate?"}, {"start": 70.06, "end": 72.14, "text": "- Would you like me to push you to the parade, Pierce?"}, {"start": 72.14, "end": 73.14, "text": "- Oh, no, thanks."}, {"start": 73.14, "end": 75.5, "text": "I don't want people to think of me as a handicap."}, {"start": 75.5, "end": 79.69919999999999, "text": "If anything, this chair makes"}, {"start": 79.69919999999999, "end": 82.74, "text": "me more than a human."}, {"start": 82.74, "end": 84.98, "text": "- You move it by blowing into this tube here."}, {"start": 84.98, "end": 86.38, "text": "It's the most expensive one."}, {"start": 86.38, "end": 91.9, "text": "I outbid three hospitals for this baby, and it was worth every penny."}, {"start": 91.9, "end": 98.884, "text": "- Wait, please,"}, {"start": 98.884, "end": 103.54, "text": "just wait."}, {"start": 103.54, "end": 106.54, "text": "I'm sorry, but I need to know who took my pen."}, {"start": 106.54, "end": 110.34, "text": "- Uh, sorry, I don't see it."}, {"start": 110.34, "end": 113.1, "text": "- Uh, sorry, Annie."}, {"start": 113.1, "end": 116.74, "text": "- No, not sorry, Annie."}, {"start": 116.74, "end": 120.02, "text": "We passed, sorry, Annie, eight pens ago."}, {"start": 120.02, "end": 122.7271264367816, "text": "I keep bringing pens, and you guys keep taking"}, {"start": 122.7271264367816, "end": 125.14, "text": "them, and I'm afraid I am putting my foot"}, {"start": 125.14, "end": 126.14, "text": "down."}, {"start": 126.14, "end": 127.14, "text": "- Okay."}, {"start": 127.14, "end": 129.2167441860465, "text": "Well, now, Annie has made it clear that this is"}, {"start": 129.2167441860465, "end": 130.94, "text": "an issue, so from now on, we need to be"}, {"start": 130.94, "end": 132.82, "text": "more respectful of her things."}, {"start": 132.82, "end": 133.82, "text": "Okay?"}, {"start": 133.82, "end": 134.82, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 134.82, "end": 140.23538461538462, "text": "All right,"}, {"start": 140.23538461538462, "end": 143.48461538461538, "text": "not on"}, {"start": 143.48461538461538, "end": 148.9, "text": "the floor."}, {"start": 148.9, "end": 155.38979591836735, "text": "So whoever accidentally took--"}, {"start": 155.38979591836735, "end": 159.5, "text": "- Not accidentally."}, {"start": 159.5, "end": 162.86, "text": "Accidents don't just happen over and over and over again, okay?"}, {"start": 162.86, "end": 164.38, "text": "This isn't budget daycare."}, {"start": 164.38, "end": 165.38, "text": "Okay?"}, {"start": 165.38, "end": 167.64516853932585, "text": "Whoever insidiously, and with great malice"}, {"start": 167.64516853932585, "end": 170.18, "text": "of forethought, abducted Annie's pen, confessed"}, {"start": 170.18, "end": 172.56, "text": "repent, and relinquished so we can leave."}, {"start": 172.56, "end": 174.14, "text": "- Maybe nobody took it."}, {"start": 174.14, "end": 176.18, "text": "Sometimes I think I lost something really important"}, {"start": 176.18, "end": 177.5, "text": "to me, and it turns out I already"}, {"start": 177.5, "end": 178.5, "text": "ate it."}, {"start": 178.5, "end": 180.26, "text": "- I didn't eat my pen, Troy."}, {"start": 180.26, "end": 183.42, "text": "I know I brought it, and now it's gone."}, {"start": 183.42, "end": 186.42, "text": "I took a photo."}, {"start": 186.42, "end": 187.42, "text": "Aha!"}, {"start": 187.42, "end": 188.42, "text": "Aha!"}, {"start": 188.42, "end": 189.42, "text": "Zoom in."}, {"start": 189.42, "end": 190.42, "text": "See?"}, {"start": 190.42, "end": 191.42, "text": "See?"}, {"start": 191.42, "end": 194.66, "text": "This, 10 minutes ago, my pen was on the table."}, {"start": 194.66, "end": 196.3, "text": "No one has come in or out since."}, {"start": 196.3, "end": 199.66, "text": "One of you has my pen right now."}, {"start": 199.66, "end": 203.16, "text": "- Annie?"}, {"start": 203.16, "end": 204.16, "text": "It's a pen."}, {"start": 204.16, "end": 205.16, "text": "- It's not a pen."}, {"start": 205.16, "end": 206.16, "text": "It's a principle."}, {"start": 206.16, "end": 210.84, "text": "- Now to get down and get a stick of gum, okay?"}, {"start": 210.84, "end": 212.46, "text": "- Are we going to the puppy parade or not?"}, {"start": 212.46, "end": 214.54, "text": "Because it's starting to feel like a bottle episode."}, {"start": 214.54, "end": 215.82, "text": "- Again with the TV crap."}, {"start": 215.82, "end": 218.34, "text": "Hey, meatball, did you take Annie's pen to"}, {"start": 218.34, "end": 220.86, "text": "make life more like Benny Hill or whatever"}, {"start": 220.86, "end": 221.86, "text": "you do?"}, {"start": 221.86, "end": 222.86, "text": "- Bobbitt?"}, {"start": 222.86, "end": 223.86, "text": "- I wouldn't do that."}, {"start": 223.86, "end": 224.86, "text": "I hate bottle episodes."}, {"start": 224.86, "end": 226.82, "text": "They're wall-to-wall facial expression and emotional nuance."}, {"start": 226.82, "end": 228.58, "text": "I might as well sit in the corner with a bucket on my head."}, {"start": 228.58, "end": 230.36786516853934, "text": "- Well, I have a photography project to"}, {"start": 230.36786516853934, "end": 232.66, "text": "finish, and my grandmother's hands aren't going to"}, {"start": 232.66, "end": 234.06, "text": "take close-ups of themselves."}, {"start": 234.06, "end": 235.38, "text": "I'll still load later."}, {"start": 235.38, "end": 236.38, "text": "Hmm."}, {"start": 236.38, "end": 239.06, "text": "Was that \"hmm\" directed at me?"}, {"start": 239.06, "end": 241.82, "text": "If the \"hmm\" fits, I don't have your pen, Annie."}, {"start": 241.82, "end": 243.1, "text": "I'm always lending you supplies."}, {"start": 243.1, "end": 244.1, "text": "You never come prepared."}, {"start": 244.1, "end": 246.5, "text": "If it's so important to you, here, have my pen."}, {"start": 246.5, "end": 247.5, "text": "- That's my pen."}, {"start": 247.5, "end": 251.82, "text": "- Whatever, people, they are just things, since they're just things, I don't suppose"}, {"start": 251.82, "end": 253.94, "text": "you mind letting us take a quick look-see inside your bag."}, {"start": 253.94, "end": 256.06, "text": "- Oh, I'd very much mind, Annie."}, {"start": 256.06, "end": 258.98, "text": "There's no such thing as a quick invasion of civil liberties."}, {"start": 258.98, "end": 259.98, "text": "- Ah."}, {"start": 259.98, "end": 260.98, "text": "- Oh, man."}, {"start": 260.98, "end": 265.38, "text": "- Oh, it all starts with a quick look-see into someone's bag, and then it's a brisk"}, {"start": 265.38, "end": 267.96476190476193, "text": "peak-a-rooney at our phone records, and before"}, {"start": 267.96476190476193, "end": 270.1, "text": "you can say \"1984,\" the thought police"}, {"start": 270.1, "end": 272.78, "text": "are forcing you to bend and spread."}, {"start": 272.78, "end": 273.78, "text": "- Bend and spread?"}, {"start": 273.78, "end": 275.06, "text": "Are the thought police going to make love to us?"}, {"start": 275.06, "end": 276.54, "text": "- Do they find thoughts in our butts?"}, {"start": 276.54, "end": 278.3, "text": "- I knew I should have read that book."}, {"start": 278.3, "end": 281.26, "text": "- Britta, stop using the Constitution as a baby blanket."}, {"start": 281.26, "end": 283.3090909090909, "text": "Last week, she invoked the Freedom of Information"}, {"start": 283.3090909090909, "end": 284.94, "text": "Act to request photocopies of my notes."}, {"start": 284.94, "end": 286.1, "text": "- That's pretty good."}, {"start": 286.1, "end": 288.24, "text": "- Well, excuse me for living free."}, {"start": 288.24, "end": 290.14, "text": "- Come on, Stoney, we all know the pen's in your bag."}, {"start": 290.14, "end": 291.14, "text": "- Yeah, come on."}, {"start": 291.14, "end": 292.14, "text": "- Yeah, come on."}, {"start": 292.14, "end": 293.14, "text": "Let's jump in."}, {"start": 293.14, "end": 294.14, "text": "- Happy."}, {"start": 294.14, "end": 297.98, "text": "- Not if that's a used Q-tip."}, {"start": 297.98, "end": 298.98, "text": "- Gross."}, {"start": 298.98, "end": 299.98, "text": "- Yes, gross."}, {"start": 299.98, "end": 305.66, "text": "Welcome to the gross business of martial law."}, {"start": 305.66, "end": 310.7, "text": "Welcome to what used to be individuality, seized and disintegrated by cowardly group"}, {"start": 310.7, "end": 311.7, "text": "think."}, {"start": 311.7, "end": 312.7, "text": "Welcome, my friends."}, {"start": 312.7, "end": 313.7, "text": "Welcome to the machine."}, {"start": 313.7, "end": 316.34, "text": "- Well, Annie, it looks like you were wrong."}, {"start": 316.34, "end": 319.42, "text": "Britta does come prepared for one thing."}, {"start": 319.42, "end": 320.42, "text": "Or six."}, {"start": 320.42, "end": 321.42, "text": "Big weekend?"}, {"start": 321.42, "end": 322.42, "text": "- Can't complain."}, {"start": 322.42, "end": 323.42, "text": "- Razzle-pazzle."}, {"start": 323.42, "end": 325.62, "text": "- Attention, students."}, {"start": 325.62, "end": 328.3, "text": "The puppy parade is starting on the quad."}, {"start": 328.3, "end": 330.26, "text": "Better come quick with every passing moment."}, {"start": 330.26, "end": 332.78, "text": "These puppies grow older and less deserving of our attention."}, {"start": 332.78, "end": 333.78, "text": "- Whoa, whoa, whoa."}, {"start": 333.78, "end": 335.82, "text": "Where do you people think you're going?"}, {"start": 335.82, "end": 339.38, "text": "- Have you ever gone to a puppy parade halfway through, Britta?"}, {"start": 339.38, "end": 340.38, "text": "It is pointless."}, {"start": 340.38, "end": 341.94, "text": "- Then you clearly stole the pen."}, {"start": 341.94, "end": 343.98, "text": "The Patriot Act cuts both ways."}, {"start": 343.98, "end": 345.14, "text": "- Actually, it's pretty one-sided."}, {"start": 345.14, "end": 346.46, "text": "It's kind of the point."}, {"start": 346.46, "end": 347.46, "text": "- Here's my point."}, {"start": 347.46, "end": 350.86, "text": "Whoever the pen thief is just stood there and watched me get Guantanamo-ed."}, {"start": 350.86, "end": 354.38, "text": "And I'd like to know who it is, so I can let them know that they have lost my trust"}, {"start": 354.38, "end": 355.38, "text": "forever."}, {"start": 355.38, "end": 356.38, "text": "- It's a bottle episode."}, {"start": 356.38, "end": 359.5, "text": "- Britta, we're sorry we embarrassed you and looked at your prophylactic equipment."}, {"start": 359.5, "end": 361.38, "text": "Your lifestyle mistakes are none of our business."}, {"start": 361.38, "end": 362.94, "text": "- Oh, thanks, Shirley."}, {"start": 362.94, "end": 366.46, "text": "And now let's wrestle through your tampons and wallets so we can apologize to you."}, {"start": 366.46, "end": 369.02, "text": "- Oh, I'm sure everybody here knows that I don't steal."}, {"start": 369.02, "end": 370.46, "text": "- Have you checked your bag, Shirley?"}, {"start": 370.46, "end": 371.78, "text": "If you took a by mistake, I forgive you."}, {"start": 371.78, "end": 373.7254545454545, "text": "- Oh, so if I took it, it's larceny, but"}, {"start": 373.7254545454545, "end": 376.06, "text": "if you find it under Mother Hen, it's a mistake."}, {"start": 376.06, "end": 377.9, "text": "- Mother Hen, I think we're about the same age."}, {"start": 377.9, "end": 379.58, "text": "- Sure, unless time is linear."}, {"start": 379.58, "end": 380.78, "text": "- I'll make your ass linear."}, {"start": 380.78, "end": 381.78, "text": "- That doesn't make any sense."}, {"start": 381.78, "end": 382.78, "text": "- I'll make your ass sense."}, {"start": 382.78, "end": 384.54, "text": "- Girls, don't get your panties puckered."}, {"start": 384.54, "end": 385.94, "text": "We all know what we're really thinking."}, {"start": 385.94, "end": 391.46, "text": "If, and I mean if, the culprit is among us, statistically speaking, it's Troy."}, {"start": 391.46, "end": 395.98, "text": "- Yes, we were all just thinking that in 1856."}, {"start": 395.98, "end": 396.98, "text": "- 1856?"}, {"start": 396.98, "end": 399.82, "text": "What if a ghost took the pen?"}, {"start": 399.82, "end": 400.82, "text": "- Please forgive him."}, {"start": 400.82, "end": 401.82, "text": "- For what?"}, {"start": 401.82, "end": 402.82, "text": "- For stealing the pen, dummy."}, {"start": 402.82, "end": 403.82, "text": "- Why would I take her pen?"}, {"start": 403.82, "end": 405.82, "text": "I don't even like having my own."}, {"start": 405.82, "end": 407.5, "text": "It's probably under one of Pierce's cast."}, {"start": 407.5, "end": 409.26, "text": "He uses everything to itch his legs."}, {"start": 409.26, "end": 411.18, "text": "We're on our third DVD remote."}, {"start": 411.18, "end": 412.68, "text": "- If I took the pen, I'd say so."}, {"start": 412.68, "end": 415.62, "text": "- You probably forgot, but then popping painkillers like tic tacs."}, {"start": 415.62, "end": 418.38, "text": "- Oh, yeah, right."}, {"start": 418.38, "end": 420.18, "text": "Side effects."}, {"start": 420.18, "end": 422.22, "text": "World dystasia."}, {"start": 422.22, "end": 423.62, "text": "And octopus loss."}, {"start": 423.62, "end": 426.26, "text": "I don't see anything in this girl about memory, Troy."}, {"start": 426.26, "end": 427.86, "text": "- Now I wanna know who has it."}, {"start": 427.86, "end": 429.1, "text": "- Yeah, nice try, Shirley."}, {"start": 429.1, "end": 430.58, "text": "That doesn't take you off the list."}, {"start": 430.58, "end": 432.22, "text": "Jeff, you're a charge."}, {"start": 432.22, "end": 433.66, "text": "I demand you deal with this."}, {"start": 433.66, "end": 434.82, "text": "- There's nothing to deal with."}, {"start": 434.82, "end": 435.82, "text": "- I'll say."}, {"start": 435.82, "end": 436.82, "text": "- Oh, okay."}, {"start": 436.82, "end": 437.82, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 437.82, "end": 438.82, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 438.82, "end": 442.46, "text": "Everyone breathe."}, {"start": 442.46, "end": 443.46, "text": "You know what this is?"}, {"start": 443.46, "end": 444.46, "text": "- Yep."}, {"start": 444.46, "end": 445.46, "text": "- Shut up."}, {"start": 445.46, "end": 447.3457142857143, "text": "This is a normal day with a bunch of friends"}, {"start": 447.3457142857143, "end": 449.06, "text": "who are done studying and a pen that may"}, {"start": 449.06, "end": 450.06, "text": "be rolled away."}, {"start": 450.06, "end": 452.38, "text": "- Or fell down someone's shoe."}, {"start": 452.38, "end": 453.38, "text": "- Let's check shoes."}, {"start": 453.38, "end": 454.38, "text": "- Annie!"}, {"start": 454.38, "end": 455.38, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 455.38, "end": 456.38, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 456.38, "end": 462.34, "text": "Someone in this room is hiding your pen."}, {"start": 462.34, "end": 463.48, "text": "Wanna know why?"}, {"start": 463.48, "end": 464.88, "text": "They feel terrible."}, {"start": 464.88, "end": 466.38, "text": "They made a mistake."}, {"start": 466.38, "end": 469.14, "text": "They waited too long to come forward, and now they feel bad."}, {"start": 469.14, "end": 470.14, "text": "- They should."}, {"start": 470.14, "end": 471.14, "text": "- Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 471.14, "end": 472.14, "text": "- Okay, okay."}, {"start": 472.14, "end": 475.74, "text": "So, pen thief, we understand what happened, and we forgive you."}, {"start": 475.74, "end": 477.1, "text": "- If you confess and apologize."}, {"start": 477.1, "end": 478.1, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 478.1, "end": 479.74, "text": "- Right, but here's the trick."}, {"start": 479.74, "end": 482.56571428571425, "text": "Does this person now has no reason not to come"}, {"start": 482.56571428571425, "end": 484.9, "text": "forward if by some chance I get to the"}, {"start": 484.9, "end": 487.9, "text": "count of three and nobody comes forward?"}, {"start": 487.9, "end": 488.98, "text": "Guess what?"}, {"start": 488.98, "end": 492.98, "text": "We have to accept that no one has the pen, don't we?"}, {"start": 492.98, "end": 493.98, "text": "- Mm."}, {"start": 493.98, "end": 494.98, "text": "- Don't we?"}, {"start": 494.98, "end": 495.98, "text": "- Mm."}, {"start": 495.98, "end": 496.98, "text": "- Good."}, {"start": 496.98, "end": 498.7, "text": "So, here we go."}, {"start": 498.7, "end": 499.7, "text": "One."}, {"start": 499.7, "end": 500.7, "text": "Two."}, {"start": 503.441, "end": 504.441, "text": "- Ah!"}, {"start": 504.441, "end": 508.721, "text": "- Pierce, you have something to tell us?"}, {"start": 508.721, "end": 509.721, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 509.721, "end": 512.3209999999999, "text": "Is it me, or has it become really obvious that Jeff took the pen?"}, {"start": 512.3209999999999, "end": 513.3209999999999, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 513.3209999999999, "end": 514.3209999999999, "text": "- Definitely could be."}, {"start": 514.3209999999999, "end": 515.881, "text": "- You want to make a bet, you jerks?"}, {"start": 515.881, "end": 516.881, "text": "Lock down!"}, {"start": 516.881, "end": 517.881, "text": "I'll bet."}, {"start": 517.881, "end": 518.881, "text": "Seal the doors."}, {"start": 518.881, "end": 521.521, "text": "Nobody leaves until this pen shows up."}, {"start": 521.521, "end": 522.521, "text": "- I don't like this."}, {"start": 522.521, "end": 525.0409999999999, "text": "- Yeah, tell it to the pen you might have."}, {"start": 525.0409999999999, "end": 526.0409999999999, "text": "Gwynifer, hi."}, {"start": 526.0409999999999, "end": 527.0409999999999, "text": "Yeah, it's me."}, {"start": 527.0409999999999, "end": 528.361, "text": "I can't make it."}, {"start": 528.361, "end": 530.8009999999999, "text": "Well, tell your disappointment to suck it."}, {"start": 530.8009999999999, "end": 533.081, "text": "I'm doing a bottle episode."}, {"start": 533.081, "end": 538.1116666666667, "text": "- Okay,"}, {"start": 538.1116666666667, "end": 540.2676666666667, "text": "you"}, {"start": 540.2676666666667, "end": 543.1423333333335, "text": "just"}, {"start": 543.1423333333335, "end": 547.4543333333335, "text": "became"}, {"start": 547.4543333333335, "end": 552.681, "text": "my hero."}, {"start": 555.341, "end": 556.4609999999999, "text": "- Thank you."}, {"start": 556.4609999999999, "end": 557.4609999999999, "text": "- No pen."}, {"start": 557.4609999999999, "end": 558.4609999999999, "text": "- I can see that."}, {"start": 558.4609999999999, "end": 560.3009999999999, "text": "Why do you keep taking that tone with me?"}, {"start": 560.3009999999999, "end": 561.381, "text": "- Oh, I'll feel that."}, {"start": 561.381, "end": 563.2223793103448, "text": "Because if nobody else has this pen, it means"}, {"start": 563.2223793103448, "end": 564.9409999999999, "text": "at some point you realized you had it, and"}, {"start": 564.9409999999999, "end": 567.4209999999999, "text": "you were too embarrassed to say, and we get to kill you."}, {"start": 567.4209999999999, "end": 571.141, "text": "- I'm not hiding my own pen, you paranoid weirdo."}, {"start": 571.141, "end": 572.4609999999999, "text": "Everybody stay within each other's eyelids, please."}, {"start": 572.4609999999999, "end": 573.4609999999999, "text": "One of you's a monster."}, {"start": 573.4609999999999, "end": 574.4609999999999, "text": "- Me next, right?"}, {"start": 574.4609999999999, "end": 575.4609999999999, "text": "- Hold on."}, {"start": 575.4609999999999, "end": 577.981, "text": "Can we please consider the threshold that we're crossing?"}, {"start": 577.981, "end": 580.5809999999999, "text": "We don't trust Abed."}, {"start": 580.5809999999999, "end": 581.741, "text": "He shredded my backpack."}, {"start": 581.741, "end": 582.741, "text": "- He freed my pet monkey."}, {"start": 582.741, "end": 584.341, "text": "- Because we corrupted him."}, {"start": 584.341, "end": 585.341, "text": "He's our innocent."}, {"start": 585.341, "end": 586.621, "text": "- He put gum in your hair."}, {"start": 586.621, "end": 587.621, "text": "- Empty the bag, Abed."}, {"start": 587.621, "end": 588.621, "text": "- Up here."}, {"start": 588.621, "end": 589.621, "text": "You don't have a bag?"}, {"start": 589.621, "end": 590.621, "text": "- Giraffe."}, {"start": 590.621, "end": 592.5409999999999, "text": "Jeff, you don't have a bag?"}, {"start": 592.5409999999999, "end": 595.5809999999999, "text": "- Oh, I could never deprive the world of the pollution in my chest the strap would"}, {"start": 595.5809999999999, "end": 596.5809999999999, "text": "cover."}, {"start": 596.5809999999999, "end": 597.5809999999999, "text": "- Makes sense."}, {"start": 597.5809999999999, "end": 598.5809999999999, "text": "So what's left?"}, {"start": 598.5809999999999, "end": 599.5809999999999, "text": "Shirley?"}, {"start": 599.5809999999999, "end": 600.5809999999999, "text": "A little hugging and crying, and then we're done?"}, {"start": 600.5809999999999, "end": 601.5809999999999, "text": "- Hey, Abed."}, {"start": 601.5809999999999, "end": 602.5809999999999, "text": "Why is my name in here?"}, {"start": 602.5809999999999, "end": 603.5809999999999, "text": "- That's mine."}, {"start": 603.5809999999999, "end": 604.5809999999999, "text": "- And Shirley's."}, {"start": 604.5809999999999, "end": 605.5809999999999, "text": "And Annie's."}, {"start": 605.5809999999999, "end": 606.5809999999999, "text": "- What is it?"}, {"start": 606.5809999999999, "end": 607.5809999999999, "text": "Charts?"}, {"start": 607.5809999999999, "end": 608.5809999999999, "text": "Some kind of calendar?"}, {"start": 608.5809999999999, "end": 611.1809999999999, "text": "- That's my personal private business."}, {"start": 611.1809999999999, "end": 613.741, "text": "- Annie four on, 28 off."}, {"start": 613.741, "end": 615.0609999999999, "text": "Next November 10th."}, {"start": 615.0609999999999, "end": 617.621, "text": "Britta five on, 27 off."}, {"start": 617.621, "end": 619.0609999999999, "text": "Oh my God."}, {"start": 619.0609999999999, "end": 621.901, "text": "Are you charting our menstrual cycles?"}, {"start": 621.901, "end": 622.901, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 622.901, "end": 623.901, "text": "Gross!"}, {"start": 623.901, "end": 626.4209999999999, "text": "- Abed, this is so personal and so accurate."}, {"start": 626.4209999999999, "end": 627.861, "text": "- Abed, this is really creepy."}, {"start": 627.861, "end": 629.5809999999999, "text": "I don't understand why you would do this."}, {"start": 629.5809999999999, "end": 630.5809999999999, "text": "- I can explain."}, {"start": 630.5809999999999, "end": 632.781, "text": "Oh, I thought you'd keep yelling over me."}, {"start": 632.781, "end": 634.0609999999999, "text": "Okay, I can explain."}, {"start": 634.0609999999999, "end": 635.3240588235294, "text": "You know I have trouble reading people and I"}, {"start": 635.3240588235294, "end": 636.501, "text": "say the wrong things sometimes and I know"}, {"start": 636.516, "end": 638.3105454545454, "text": "it was happening more often with you three than"}, {"start": 638.3105454545454, "end": 639.876, "text": "it was with the others and then I noticed"}, {"start": 639.876, "end": 641.9437647058824, "text": "fluctuating patterns and I started graphing them and"}, {"start": 641.9437647058824, "end": 643.256, "text": "by the time I realized what I was"}, {"start": 643.256, "end": 645.1959999999999, "text": "actually measuring it had started to yield"}, {"start": 645.1959999999999, "end": 647.136, "text": "really positive results for everybody so I"}, {"start": 647.136, "end": 648.136, "text": "kept doing it."}, {"start": 648.136, "end": 654.5759999999999, "text": "Were you ever going to tell us about this I feel so violated."}, {"start": 654.5759999999999, "end": 655.5759999999999, "text": "More chocolate?"}, {"start": 655.5759999999999, "end": 659.0559999999999, "text": "Get away from me."}, {"start": 659.0559999999999, "end": 660.0559999999999, "text": "Ava just became my hero."}, {"start": 660.0559999999999, "end": 662.0559999999999, "text": "Can I have a little-"}, {"start": 662.0559999999999, "end": 663.0559999999999, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 663.0559999999999, "end": 666.496, "text": "I guess it's true what they say about their sync up."}, {"start": 666.496, "end": 667.9247058823529, "text": "Okay if I could just take this time to share"}, {"start": 667.9247058823529, "end": 669.256, "text": "a few words of sarcasm with whoever it is"}, {"start": 669.256, "end": 670.256, "text": "that took this pen."}, {"start": 670.256, "end": 672.9359999999999, "text": "I want to say thank you for doing this to me."}, {"start": 672.9359999999999, "end": 674.2011162790697, "text": "For a while I thought I'd have to suffer"}, {"start": 674.2011162790697, "end": 675.656, "text": "through a puppy parade but I much prefer being"}, {"start": 675.656, "end": 679.736, "text": "entombed alive in a mausoleum of feelings I can either understand nor reciprocate."}, {"start": 679.736, "end": 681.8159999999999, "text": "So whoever you are can I give you anything?"}, {"start": 681.8159999999999, "end": 682.8159999999999, "text": "Ice cream?"}, {"start": 682.8159999999999, "end": 683.8159999999999, "text": "Best friend metal?"}, {"start": 683.8159999999999, "end": 684.8159999999999, "text": "Anything?"}, {"start": 684.8159999999999, "end": 685.8159999999999, "text": "Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 685.8159999999999, "end": 687.016, "text": "Okay sarcasm over."}, {"start": 687.016, "end": 688.016, "text": "Your last up Shirley."}, {"start": 688.016, "end": 689.656, "text": "Dump your comedically huge bag and end this."}, {"start": 689.656, "end": 691.656, "text": "Uh, no thank you."}, {"start": 694.309, "end": 695.989, "text": "Oh, well, well."}, {"start": 695.989, "end": 696.989, "text": "Harvey Keitel."}, {"start": 696.989, "end": 700.269, "text": "Well, what do you know, Henry David Thoreau?"}, {"start": 700.269, "end": 704.669, "text": "My oh my my tie, son."}, {"start": 704.669, "end": 705.669, "text": "Just empty the bag."}, {"start": 705.669, "end": 706.669, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 706.669, "end": 707.669, "text": "I don't have any spin!"}, {"start": 707.669, "end": 709.629, "text": "I'm simply a Christian woman that doesn't open her bag."}, {"start": 709.629, "end": 712.829, "text": "What did the Christian woman think would happen when we got to her bag?"}, {"start": 712.829, "end": 714.509, "text": "The Christian woman thought you found it on the mausoleum."}, {"start": 714.509, "end": 715.509, "text": "Real nice."}, {"start": 715.509, "end": 716.509, "text": "Nicer than you condom carrier!"}, {"start": 716.509, "end": 717.509, "text": "Don't the bagger your guilty?"}, {"start": 717.509, "end": 718.509, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 718.509, "end": 719.509, "text": "Oh no!"}, {"start": 719.509, "end": 720.509, "text": "He's thrown a clock!"}, {"start": 720.509, "end": 721.509, "text": "Piers?"}, {"start": 721.509, "end": 722.509, "text": "I'm out of here!"}, {"start": 722.509, "end": 724.509, "text": "I'm out of here!"}, {"start": 724.509, "end": 725.509, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 725.509, "end": 726.509, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 726.509, "end": 727.829, "text": "Piers, you didn't need to do that!"}, {"start": 727.829, "end": 728.829, "text": "Yes I did."}, {"start": 728.829, "end": 732.149, "text": "All you guys do is talk, leaving me to do the things you won't do."}, {"start": 732.149, "end": 737.4689999999999, "text": "People like you are the reason we took so long to get into Vietnam."}, {"start": 737.4689999999999, "end": 739.869, "text": "Is this what you were trying to hide Shirley?"}, {"start": 739.869, "end": 741.749, "text": "A pregnancy test?"}, {"start": 741.749, "end": 745.549, "text": "And more importantly, are they seriously marketing pregnancy tests in black women?"}, {"start": 745.549, "end": 749.789, "text": "Guys, this is a terribly childish way to handle this kind of situation."}, {"start": 749.789, "end": 753.1089999999999, "text": "Does this mean you have any boyfriend?"}, {"start": 753.1089999999999, "end": 757.029, "text": "Nothing is anyone's business."}, {"start": 757.029, "end": 761.269, "text": "I recently reconnected with my husband over Labor Day and it seems the Lord may have"}, {"start": 761.269, "end": 764.189, "text": "a plan for us that doesn't include that stripper slut he ran away with."}, {"start": 764.189, "end": 765.189, "text": "You're not pregnant Shirley, it's impossible."}, {"start": 765.189, "end": 766.189, "text": "Why does everybody think I'm old?"}, {"start": 766.189, "end": 769.189, "text": "I'm around Jeff's age, I have a uterus!"}, {"start": 769.189, "end": 770.569, "text": "No, no, according to my chart, you couldn't"}, {"start": 770.569, "end": 771.949, "text": "have conceived Labor Day Weekend, you would"}, {"start": 771.949, "end": 774.749, "text": "have been ovulating Halloween."}, {"start": 774.749, "end": 775.8164418604651, "text": "Which is just as well because if you're going"}, {"start": 775.8164418604651, "end": 776.789, "text": "to have a pregnant woman in one of these,"}, {"start": 776.789, "end": 779.189, "text": "I say go elevate her labor and go home."}, {"start": 779.189, "end": 781.709, "text": "Well, that's that then."}, {"start": 781.709, "end": 782.8689999999999, "text": "Yeah, what a relief."}, {"start": 782.8689999999999, "end": 785.749, "text": "Looks like someone narrowly avoided a lifestyle mistake of their own."}, {"start": 785.749, "end": 788.909, "text": "Oh, or is it only bad if you sleep with unmarried men?"}, {"start": 788.909, "end": 792.269, "text": "The Bible doesn't recognize divorce Britain when you marry a man, he's your man!"}, {"start": 792.269, "end": 795.549, "text": "Yeah, and after he marries someone else, if you jump into the sack with him, you're"}, {"start": 795.549, "end": 798.3489999999999, "text": "an angel, so long as you don't use protection."}, {"start": 798.3489999999999, "end": 801.7070952380952, "text": "I'm so glad you're enjoying this and I hope"}, {"start": 801.7070952380952, "end": 804.909, "text": "whoever stole that pin enjoys it in hell!"}, {"start": 804.909, "end": 806.069, "text": "Nice try Stephen Fry."}, {"start": 806.069, "end": 807.3489999999999, "text": "Stephen Fry!"}, {"start": 807.3489999999999, "end": 808.829, "text": "We all have an agreement."}, {"start": 808.829, "end": 810.309, "text": "We leave till we find it."}, {"start": 810.309, "end": 816.149, "text": "You know, here we go, we are going to find this pen."}, {"start": 816.149, "end": 818.5889999999999, "text": "We are going to find that pen!"}, {"start": 818.5889999999999, "end": 823.149, "text": "And if we can't find it, our children will find it."}, {"start": 823.149, "end": 824.149, "text": "Is it over here?"}, {"start": 824.149, "end": 825.149, "text": "The pen!"}, {"start": 825.149, "end": 826.149, "text": "The incredible, magical pen that nobody knows how it can disappear."}, {"start": 826.149, "end": 827.149, "text": "Oh, maybe it's right in here."}, {"start": 827.149, "end": 828.149, "text": "Guys!"}, {"start": 828.149, "end": 829.149, "text": "Is this whole property?"}, {"start": 829.149, "end": 830.149, "text": "We didn't know about it!"}, {"start": 830.149, "end": 831.149, "text": "Forget it!"}, {"start": 831.149, "end": 832.149, "text": "It's a pen!"}, {"start": 832.149, "end": 837.9775714285714, "text": "It's a"}, {"start": 837.9775714285714, "end": 841.3081836734694, "text": "pen"}, {"start": 841.3081836734694, "end": 845.749, "text": "now?"}, {"start": 851.679, "end": 854.279, "text": "Really?"}, {"start": 854.279, "end": 856.6389999999999, "text": "It's not a principle anymore?"}, {"start": 856.6389999999999, "end": 857.6389999999999, "text": "Now it's a pen?"}, {"start": 857.6389999999999, "end": 862.4789999999999, "text": "Why the change of heart?"}, {"start": 862.4789999999999, "end": 865.3989999999999, "text": "You're not seriously accusing me."}, {"start": 865.3989999999999, "end": 866.7589999999999, "text": "We searched my bag."}, {"start": 866.7589999999999, "end": 871.199, "text": "Which is exactly the last place you put it if you found it halfway through all this."}, {"start": 871.199, "end": 873.8166744186046, "text": "In fact, assuming that one of us does have"}, {"start": 873.8166744186046, "end": 876.559, "text": "the pen, who among us has the most incentive"}, {"start": 876.559, "end": 878.559, "text": "to make sure it never sees the light of day?"}, {"start": 878.559, "end": 879.559, "text": "You want to go there?"}, {"start": 879.559, "end": 880.559, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 880.559, "end": 881.559, "text": "I'll go there."}, {"start": 881.559, "end": 882.559, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 882.559, "end": 883.559, "text": "I was born there."}, {"start": 883.559, "end": 884.559, "text": "Really?"}, {"start": 884.559, "end": 886.059, "text": "There's a placard there commemorating me!"}, {"start": 886.059, "end": 888.279, "text": "What's going on and how can I help?"}, {"start": 888.279, "end": 889.279, "text": "Annie, relax."}, {"start": 889.279, "end": 890.279, "text": "No, you relax, Jeff."}, {"start": 890.279, "end": 893.319, "text": "Or are you scared that if you do, my pen will fall out?"}, {"start": 893.319, "end": 895.6389999999999, "text": "Oh, you precocious little bitch!"}, {"start": 895.6389999999999, "end": 898.1189999999999, "text": "Okay, guys, guys, hey, guys, stop!"}, {"start": 898.1189999999999, "end": 899.3589999999999, "text": "You're being completely illogical!"}, {"start": 899.3589999999999, "end": 901.1580804597701, "text": "We need to flip the table, divide the group"}, {"start": 901.1580804597701, "end": 902.9989999999999, "text": "by gender, and then search each other in our"}, {"start": 902.9989999999999, "end": 903.9989999999999, "text": "underwear."}, {"start": 903.9989999999999, "end": 904.9989999999999, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 904.9989999999999, "end": 906.9189999999999, "text": "Now what?"}, {"start": 906.9189999999999, "end": 907.9189999999999, "text": "Everybody shake."}, {"start": 907.9189999999999, "end": 909.9189999999999, "text": "Enough to dislodge."}, {"start": 909.9189999999999, "end": 914.2389999999999, "text": "Okay, anything hit the floor?"}, {"start": 914.2389999999999, "end": 915.2389999999999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 915.2389999999999, "end": 916.9189999999999, "text": "What are those underwear made out of?"}, {"start": 916.9189999999999, "end": 917.9189999999999, "text": "They look luxurious."}, {"start": 917.9189999999999, "end": 920.039, "text": "Oh, they're an organic soy cotton blend."}, {"start": 920.039, "end": 922.279, "text": "This Gwynifer must be real special."}, {"start": 922.279, "end": 924.8789999999999, "text": "Don't you usually wear the stripey turquoise beetle juice numbers?"}, {"start": 924.8789999999999, "end": 926.519, "text": "What does she mean usually?"}, {"start": 926.519, "end": 929.2389999999999, "text": "All right, end of the road."}, {"start": 929.2389999999999, "end": 930.759, "text": "We've torn apart the room."}, {"start": 930.759, "end": 931.959, "text": "We've stripped."}, {"start": 931.959, "end": 934.6789999999999, "text": "There is absolutely no place left--"}, {"start": 934.6789999999999, "end": 935.6789999999999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 935.6789999999999, "end": 936.6789999999999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 936.6789999999999, "end": 937.6789999999999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 937.6789999999999, "end": 938.6789999999999, "text": "Damn it."}, {"start": 938.6789999999999, "end": 942.6789999999999, "text": "I broke your scissors."}, {"start": 942.6789999999999, "end": 943.6789999999999, "text": "Here."}, {"start": 943.6789999999999, "end": 944.6789999999999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 944.6789999999999, "end": 945.6789999999999, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 945.6789999999999, "end": 946.6789999999999, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 946.6789999999999, "end": 947.6789999999999, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 947.6789999999999, "end": 948.6789999999999, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 948.6789999999999, "end": 949.6789999999999, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 949.6789999999999, "end": 950.6789999999999, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 950.6789999999999, "end": 951.6789999999999, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 951.6789999999999, "end": 952.6789999999999, "text": "Damn it!"}, {"start": 952.6789999999999, "end": 953.6789999999999, "text": "I broke your scissors."}, {"start": 953.6789999999999, "end": 954.6789999999999, "text": "Here."}, {"start": 954.6789999999999, "end": 955.6789999999999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 955.6789999999999, "end": 956.6789999999999, "text": "Be careful."}, {"start": 956.6789999999999, "end": 958.759, "text": "This is the last pair we have."}, {"start": 958.759, "end": 959.759, "text": "Also don't cut his legs."}, {"start": 959.759, "end": 960.759, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 960.759, "end": 962.759, "text": "I'm worried we've gone too far."}, {"start": 962.759, "end": 964.799, "text": "This is how supervillains are created."}, {"start": 964.799, "end": 966.9023707865168, "text": "Can't you just make an inspiring winger speech about"}, {"start": 966.9023707865168, "end": 968.3989999999999, "text": "trust, throw in a few digs as an easy"}, {"start": 968.3989999999999, "end": 970.9189999999999, "text": "celebrity target and put a ribbon on this thing?"}, {"start": 970.9189999999999, "end": 971.9189999999999, "text": "I'll bet."}, {"start": 971.9189999999999, "end": 973.7189999999999, "text": "Think about this for one second."}, {"start": 973.7189999999999, "end": 975.9585348837209, "text": "If a single one of us leaves this room before"}, {"start": 975.9585348837209, "end": 977.9989999999999, "text": "we find that pen, how can any of us trust"}, {"start": 977.9989999999999, "end": 980.9989999999999, "text": "anyone in this group ever again?"}, {"start": 980.9989999999999, "end": 982.9989999999999, "text": "Sure, hurry."}, {"start": 982.9989999999999, "end": 984.959, "text": "I'm cloving myself."}, {"start": 984.959, "end": 987.1545555555556, "text": "I'm not comfortable standing around in my altogether"}, {"start": 987.1545555555556, "end": 988.759, "text": "like you two, Anna, Rex, and Jez and--"}, {"start": 988.759, "end": 990.519, "text": "Oh, I'm so sorry."}, {"start": 990.519, "end": 991.519, "text": "It was really mean."}, {"start": 991.519, "end": 993.6789999999999, "text": "I don't know where that came from."}, {"start": 993.6789999999999, "end": 995.8557441860464, "text": "We've all been through a lot today, and"}, {"start": 995.8557441860464, "end": 998.4789999999999, "text": "I'm sure this pregnancy scare has been weighing"}, {"start": 998.4789999999999, "end": 1000.4789999999999, "text": "on you all week, right?"}, {"start": 1000.4789999999999, "end": 1001.4789999999999, "text": "Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 1001.4789999999999, "end": 1003.4789999999999, "text": "Well, maybe that's why you took my pen."}, {"start": 1003.4789999999999, "end": 1004.4789999999999, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 1004.4789999999999, "end": 1005.4789999999999, "text": "Where are you hiding it, judging people?"}, {"start": 1005.4789999999999, "end": 1006.4789999999999, "text": "Oh, my--"}, {"start": 1006.4789999999999, "end": 1007.4789999999999, "text": "You-- you-- you-- you--"}, {"start": 1007.4789999999999, "end": 1008.4789999999999, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 1008.4789999999999, "end": 1009.4789999999999, "text": "Here we go."}, {"start": 1009.4789999999999, "end": 1010.4789999999999, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1010.4789999999999, "end": 1011.4789999999999, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1011.4789999999999, "end": 1012.4789999999999, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1012.4789999999999, "end": 1013.4789999999999, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1013.4789999999999, "end": 1014.4789999999999, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1014.4789999999999, "end": 1015.9189999999999, "text": "It smells like a Waffle House sink."}, {"start": 1015.9189999999999, "end": 1019.559, "text": "Pierce, are you using Slim Jims to scratch your legs?"}, {"start": 1019.559, "end": 1022.8789999999999, "text": "Have we not gotten to a place free of judgment yet?"}, {"start": 1022.8789999999999, "end": 1024.239, "text": "This isn't it."}, {"start": 1024.239, "end": 1025.239, "text": "This isn't it."}, {"start": 1025.239, "end": 1026.239, "text": "Where is it?"}, {"start": 1026.239, "end": 1027.239, "text": "Where's the pen?"}, {"start": 1027.239, "end": 1031.239, "text": "Where's the pen?"}, {"start": 1031.239, "end": 1034.839, "text": "It's getting a little chilly outside, so the animal wranglers have asked that every"}, {"start": 1034.839, "end": 1039.239, "text": "student pick up a puppy and hold it, so they stay warm while the volunteers hand out"}, {"start": 1039.239, "end": 1040.839, "text": "tiny puppy-sized hats."}, {"start": 1040.839, "end": 1044.559, "text": "Honestly, I don't know why I'm even making these announcements."}, {"start": 1044.559, "end": 1048.599, "text": "There can't be anyone who isn't already on the quad."}, {"start": 1048.599, "end": 1053.839, "text": "Annie, I'd just like to say on behalf of whoever actually stole this pen, I really"}, {"start": 1062.158, "end": 1063.838, "text": "am sorry about all this."}, {"start": 1063.838, "end": 1064.838, "text": "I knew it was you."}, {"start": 1064.838, "end": 1065.838, "text": "I knew it was you."}, {"start": 1065.838, "end": 1068.118, "text": "All I know is it could be any of you."}, {"start": 1068.118, "end": 1070.478, "text": "And for all we know, it's you."}, {"start": 1070.478, "end": 1071.478, "text": "I wish it were."}, {"start": 1071.478, "end": 1072.478, "text": "I really do."}, {"start": 1072.478, "end": 1074.518, "text": "I wish I could just find it behind my ear."}, {"start": 1074.518, "end": 1076.3166813186813, "text": "I'd rather be that stupid than have to think"}, {"start": 1076.3166813186813, "end": 1078.238, "text": "that any one of us might be this inconsiderate."}, {"start": 1078.238, "end": 1084.1979999999999, "text": "After all we've been through, it almost seems impossible."}, {"start": 1084.1979999999999, "end": 1088.958, "text": "It seems less than impossible."}, {"start": 1088.958, "end": 1092.638, "text": "Something impossible actually seems more likely."}, {"start": 1092.638, "end": 1094.518, "text": "Here we go."}, {"start": 1094.518, "end": 1096.518, "text": "When your speech is to take us home."}, {"start": 1096.518, "end": 1097.758, "text": "What if a ghost took the pen?"}, {"start": 1097.758, "end": 1098.758, "text": "Let him finish."}, {"start": 1098.758, "end": 1099.758, "text": "I am finished."}, {"start": 1099.758, "end": 1100.758, "text": "For real."}, {"start": 1100.758, "end": 1101.758, "text": "Honestly, seriously."}, {"start": 1101.758, "end": 1102.758, "text": "Why not?"}, {"start": 1102.758, "end": 1104.438, "text": "Why not just a ghost took the pen?"}, {"start": 1104.438, "end": 1105.438, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 1105.438, "end": 1107.078, "text": "I've been saying that for hours."}, {"start": 1107.078, "end": 1109.518, "text": "We should have been listening to Troy from the beginning."}, {"start": 1109.518, "end": 1113.518, "text": "Guys, look in your hearts and answer this question honestly."}, {"start": 1113.518, "end": 1116.5394285714285, "text": "What's more likely that someone in this group"}, {"start": 1116.5394285714285, "end": 1119.158, "text": "doesn't belong in this group or ghosts?"}, {"start": 1119.158, "end": 1121.358, "text": "If we have to choose between turning on each"}, {"start": 1121.358, "end": 1123.358, "text": "other or pinning it on some specter with"}, {"start": 1123.358, "end": 1128.878, "text": "unfinished pen-related business, I'm sorry, but my money's on ghosts."}, {"start": 1128.878, "end": 1131.2459999999999, "text": "Well, I'm not a religious person, but"}, {"start": 1131.2459999999999, "end": 1134.318, "text": "I've seen specials on the paranormal, anything's"}, {"start": 1134.318, "end": 1135.318, "text": "possible."}, {"start": 1135.318, "end": 1140.078, "text": "But relative to the alternative, it actually seems more logical to me."}, {"start": 1140.078, "end": 1144.718, "text": "Why would a ghost want a pen, Troy?"}, {"start": 1148.86, "end": 1150.78, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 1150.78, "end": 1152.8132584269663, "text": "So I see it as a lot like the"}, {"start": 1152.8132584269663, "end": 1157.02, "text": "movie Paranormal Activity, except for more boring and fancy."}, {"start": 1157.02, "end": 1162.22, "text": "And I think in 1856, it is possible that a man was beheaded while he was writing in"}, {"start": 1162.22, "end": 1167.54, "text": "his diary to his long-lost love, and now he roams the halls of Greendale screaming"}, {"start": 1167.54, "end": 1169.78, "text": "for his pen so he can write her love letter."}, {"start": 1169.78, "end": 1170.78, "text": "\"I need her."}, {"start": 1170.78, "end": 1177.6361904761904, "text": "I need her,\" he screams"}, {"start": 1177.6361904761904, "end": 1183.3, "text": "as he looks for it."}, {"start": 1183.3, "end": 1188.34, "text": "What the hell did you people do in there?"}, {"start": 1188.34, "end": 1191.6355294117645, "text": "Something you and your puppies could only dream"}, {"start": 1191.6355294117645, "end": 1194.3, "text": "of, you non-miraculous son of a bitch."}, {"start": 1194.3, "end": 1195.3, "text": "Non-miraculous?"}, {"start": 1195.3, "end": 1196.3, "text": "Wait!"}, {"start": 1196.3, "end": 1198.3, "text": "Fabio!"}, {"start": 1233.05, "end": 1237.05, "text": "Now who could resist falling in love with our next float?"}, {"start": 1239.618, "end": 1243.3557049180326, "text": "This autumn colors puppy reminds us that while the leaves"}, {"start": 1243.3557049180326, "end": 1247.618, "text": "might be changing, responsible pet ownership is always in season."}, {"start": 1247.618, "end": 1251.618, "text": "Oh, here's a crowd favorite, the top and tails float."}, {"start": 1251.618, "end": 1254.618, "text": "A champagne bath and a red sports car?"}, {"start": 1254.618, "end": 1256.618, "text": "Let's hope he's single!"}, {"start": 1256.618, "end": 1258.618, "text": "Oh, okay."}, {"start": 1258.618, "end": 1260.618, "text": "Well, this one feels a little preachy."}, {"start": 1260.618, "end": 1261.618, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 1261.618, "end": 1262.618, "text": "Boo!"}, {"start": 1262.618, "end": 1264.618, "text": "Boo!"}, {"start": 1264.618, "end": 1266.618, "text": "Boo!"}]}